RootlessVM — third-party components
===================================

This project is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE).

It builds against, derives from, or bundles at runtime the following
upstream open-source components (all GPL-compatible). Exact pinned
versions are recorded in AGENT.md §3.

- Vector (github.com/JingMatrix/Vector) — GPL-3.0
  Xposed framework continuation; source of the ART hooking injection
  layer (LSPlant, Dobby, XposedBridge, lspd) built by vector/build_vector.sh
  from pinned commit ddeed8c.
- LSPlant — as bundled by Vector
  ART method hooking engine used via Vector.
- Dobby — as bundled by Vector
  Inline hooking library used via Vector.
- proot — GPL-2.0-or-later (github.com/proot-me/proot)
  User-space syscall translation; built from source by proot/build_proot.sh.
- Android Open Source Project (AOSP) / LineageOS-derived rootfs
  Apache-2.0 / GPL — downloaded at first launch with SHA-256 verification,
  not distributed as a proprietary image.
- AndroidX / Jetpack Compose — Apache-2.0
- kotlinx.serialization — Apache-2.0

No proprietary binaries, trackers, or analytics are included.
